* Focused diode-family models used by Xyce model binding.
* BAT54 parameters are a compact Schottky approximation for Workbench smoke/QA.
.MODEL BAT54 D(IS=2.0e-8 RS=2.0 N=1.08 CJO=10p VJ=0.35 M=0.35 EG=0.69 XTI=2 BV=30 IBV=10u)

* Generic voltage-coded zener used when the UI value is 5V1 instead of a part number.
.MODEL ZENER_5V1 D(IS=1n RS=2 N=1.5 CJO=100p BV=5.1 IBV=1m)

* Generic LED colour models. Named real LEDs should get their own vendor .MODEL later.
.MODEL LED_RED D(IS=1.0e-18 RS=8 N=2.0 CJO=5p)
.MODEL LED_GREEN D(IS=3.0e-20 RS=8 N=2.0 CJO=5p)
.MODEL LED_YELLOW D(IS=2.0e-19 RS=8 N=2.0 CJO=5p)
.MODEL LED_BLUE D(IS=2.0e-25 RS=8 N=2.0 CJO=5p)
.MODEL LED_WHITE D(IS=2.0e-25 RS=8 N=2.0 CJO=5p)
